<div class="auth-card"><div class="verification-icon">✉</div><div class="auth-heading centered"><span class="eyebrow">Staff verification</span><h2>Check your email</h2><p>Enter the six-digit sign-in code. It expires in 10 minutes.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= url('mfa') ?>" class="auth-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><label><span>Verification code</span><input class="otp-input" name="code" required inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autofocus placeholder="000000"><?= error('code')?'<small class="field-error">'.e(error('code')).'</small>':'' ?></label><button class="button button-primary button-block" type="submit">Verify & continue →</button></form><form method="post" action="<?= url('mfa/resend') ?>" class="auth-resend"><?= csrf_field() ?><span>Didn’t receive it? Check Spam first.</span><button type="submit">Send a new code</button></form><div class="security-note"><span>i</span><p>Staff OTP delivery requires tested SMTP delivery. Configure it in <b>Admin Settings → Email & SMTP</b>. For Gmail, use a Google App Password—not the normal Gmail password.</p></div><p class="auth-switch"><a href="<?= url('login') ?>">Return to sign in</a></p></div>
